# iCloud conflict copies. This repository lives under ~/Documents, which is
# synced, and a generated file edited on two machines comes back as "X 2.ext".
# They are junk over generated output; delete them when they appear.
* [0-9].xcodeproj/
* [0-9].xcworkspace/

# Fuzz harness (GAPS.md §5.2): generated seed corpus, grown corpus
# entries, regression images, and crash artifacts. Seeds regenerate with
# tools/fuzz.sh; regression images regenerate with tools/fuzz/mkregression.py;
# a crash worth keeping becomes a regression test, not a corpus blob.
tools/fuzz/corpus/
tools/fuzz/regression/
tools/fuzz/crashes/
build-fuzz/
